  "title": "Hajj And Umrah Full Guide",
  "url": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/hajj-and-umrah-full-guide/id6504139758?uo=4",
  "description": "The application contains the following sections\n\nHajj section includes the following:\nHajj rituals: An explanation of the Hajj rituals, including videos, books, and pictures\nHajj to-do list: It helps you know the tasks you have accomplished and the remaining tasks\nHajj takbeers: An explanation of Hajj takbeers according to the Noble Prophet’s Sunnah, including texts, videos, and pictures\nRemembrances for Hajj and Umrah: It includes the Sunnah remembrances for Hajj and Umrah in the form of text cards\nLessons on Hajj: These are educational videos about Hajj from many sheikhs\nHajj Fatwas: Many questions and answers related to Hajj and Umrah\nHajj and Umrah Terminology: Some terms you need to understand regarding Hajj and Umrah\nWorks equivalent to Hajj and Umrah: If you are not able to perform Hajj or Umrah this year, these works are equivalent to performing Hajj and Umrah.\nThe Holy Quran\nProphetic tradition\nMaps: Many maps in the form of pictures of the Grand Mosque, the Prophet’s Mosque, and other maps\n\nUmrah section includes the following:\nUmrah rituals: An explanation of Umrah rituals that includes texts, pictures, videos, and books\nUmrah To-Do List: To know what you have completed and what remains to be done\nLessons about Umrah: Educational videos about Umrah by many sheikhs\n\nEid al-Adha section includes\nAn explanation of the Eid prayer and how to perform it\nGreeting cards to send to your friends, relatives and family\n\nEvents section includes\nReligious songs about Hajj, Umrah and Eid\nGift Ideas: Helps you choose gifts to take with you on your way back with places to buy from\nPlaces to visit in Saudi Arabia: Suggestions for many beautiful places in Saudi Arabia that can be visited in addition to religious places\nWeather in Saudi Arabia: Helps you stay informed about weather conditions in Saudi Arabia\nCurrency Converter: Helps you calculate the exchange rate between currencies\n\nWithin each section you can add content to your favorites for quick access and you can search the entire content",
